        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 103, Traditional Privacy Lock</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOmnia's 103 privacy bolt features the classic beauty that is iconic of traditional decor--simple yet timelessly elegant. Privacy bolts are most often used on bedrooms and bathrooms. This bolt is not meant for security purposes as, in case of emergencies, the bolt can be retracted from the exterior side of the door through the emergency release rose. For doors 1-3/8 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Privacy Bolt (Bathroom and Bedroom):</b> Locks but has access to unlock from the outside via emergency turn. Privacy locks do not offer security, they offer privacy. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 103 Traditional Privacy Door Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter (both interior and exterior): 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Faceplate Height: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Faceplate Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Height: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt: 9/16\" throw solid brass bolt</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" - 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes: faceplate, strike, dustbox, bolt, interior rose with turnpiece, and emergency release exterior rose.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Will not cover a 2-1/8\" pre-drilled door borehole.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MHE-Oiled-pinapple.jpg?v=1704354543\" width=\"600\" height=\"107\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
