                "title": "Traditional Privacy Bolt",
                "description": "Omnia's 103 privacy bolt features the classic beauty that is iconic of traditional decor--simple yet timelessly elegant. Privacy bolts are most often used on bedrooms and bathrooms. This bolt is not meant for security purposes as, in case of emergencies, the bolt can be retracted from the exterior side of the door through the emergency release rose. For doors 1-3/8 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n",
